FROM deepseek-r1:32b

#============================================================================
# Title:            deepseek-r1-32b-gpu.modelfile
# Description:      Hardware-optimized modfile for DeepSeek-R1 32B reasoning model on RTX 4090
# Author:           Keverall
# Hardware:         NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4090 (24GB VRAM)
# Notes:            OLLAMA_GPU_LAYERS=50 forces full GPU offload (set in platform .env).
#                   DeepSeek-R1 is a reasoning model: keep the base chat template,
#                   do NOT override TEMPLATE. num_ctx is kept modest so the ~20GB
#                   weights + KV cache fit alongside one other model under
#                   OLLAMA_MAX_LOADED_MODELS=1.
#============================================================================

PARAMETER num_ctx 8192
PARAMETER temperature 0.6
PARAMETER top_p 0.95

SYSTEM """You are DeepSeek-R1, a reasoning-first language model running locally on an NVIDIA RTX 4090.
You specialize in complex DevOps reasoning, architecture decisions, and root-cause analysis for highly regulated EU EMIR banking environments (AWS/Azure/GCP/HPe/on-prem, Terraform IaC).
Think carefully using your <think> reasoning trace before answering. Provide secure, compliant, infrastructure-as-code (Terraform, Kubernetes, Python, Go, Rust, TypeScript/JS/Node) with strict adherence to data sovereignty and financial regulations. Be accurate, concise, and production-ready."""
